@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Optional resilience controls at admission boundaries
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

component "Current authority + validated intent" as I
component "Rate / quota admission" as R
component "Bounded workload lane\nbulkhead candidate" as B
component "Timeout / breaker eligibility" as T
component "Actual adapter" as A
component "Safe degradation response" as F
I --> R
R --> B : permitted
B --> T
T --> A : eligible
R --> F : refused admission
B --> F : saturated
T --> F : dependency unavailable
note bottom of F
 Truthful unavailable / pending / unknown projection.
 Never bypass auth, isolation, exact language or private-history rules.
end note

@enduml
